# Shore Leave Planet: "This land enters tapped. {T}: Add {U}. {4}{U}: This land becomes a copy of target creature you control
# until end of turn, except it isn't legendary and it's a Robot artifact in addition to its other types." It enters tapped
# (CR 614.1d) and taps for one blue. On turn 5 it copies Bot1's own Grizzly Bears - Bot2's Llanowar Elves refused, "you
# control" - so it is a 2/2 Bear that is also a Robot artifact (CR 707.9b, "in addition to its other types"); the effect ends
# in the cleanup step (CR 514.2) and it is a land again on turn 7. On turn 7 it copies the legendary Isamaru and both stay,
# which is what pins "it isn't legendary" (CR 704.5j).

